message: "If you use these files, please cite both the paper and this deposit."
title: "Parametric device generators for a geometry-first 3D-printed microfluidic valve framework"
abstract: "OpenSCAD sources for the Printability and Functionality test devices used to
  establish printability bounds, measure the membrane deflection coefficient, and derive
  spherical valve-seat geometry for monolithically 3D-printed microfluidic membrane valves."
